WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.160
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier and welcome back to Subnautica.

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:08.280
We've got a lot of stuff to do, but now we finally have the tools to do it.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.960
So I'm going to take some of these for the road

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:13.100
to munch on while I'm swimming the long way back.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.680
Good thing I got an extra battery.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.820
So I need to get over to the Aurora.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:22.040
First, I got to make a pit stop at the life pod, which I can juuusssttt barely see in the distance over there!

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:24.900
Then, I need to build a base by the Aurora.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.700
So I am all done here, I'm pretty sure I scanned everything that I need.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.280
The only thing I don't have is marble-melon?

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.240
Uhh, but I think I'll be okay without the marble-melon.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.860
DIVE! (5x)

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.760
Ow. My legs, and knees, and intestines.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:47.900
So I'm going to make my way over to the, uh, life pod and then to the Aurora to build my base.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.900
So, anyway, I'm going to do that now.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.720
I'll be back in a bit. Love you! *blows a kiss*

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:55.360
Did my life pod drift back to the right place?

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:56.400
I think it did!

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:57.560
Good for you, Bubba.

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.160
You know where your home is.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:00.320
Okay, God, I have another message.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.180
I don't want to know!

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:03.260
I don't wanna know!

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:04.720
