00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:16.620
YEEEE-ES!

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:18.360
FFF-FINALLY!

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:19.960
FFF-FINALLY!

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:23.560
