00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:24.340
(wait, hold on, what?)

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:25.840
Dick joke. (oh, jeez. -_-)

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:26.900
*sound of arousal?*

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:29.100
Okay, but we got what we needed; now I can make a fabricator.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:32.820
And then finally, I can just pick up the scrap pieces, turn 'em into titanium!

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.980
This shouldn't have take so long!

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:37.160
*baby talk* I don't know why it did!

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.440
But it did, and I will...

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:40.660
*POWER FLOOF*

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:41.980
...I will survive.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:43.580
I will survive!

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.420
I will persevere!

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:51.220
I will do whatever it takes to survive in the dark depths of the fuckin' ocea-aah-n.

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:52.900
Okay, alright. *Helen: "Welcome aboard, Captain."*

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:53.520
Bo-kay.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:54.200
Here we go.

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:55.700
Shoop-yes.

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:57.480
My whoop. Yes.

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:58.960
Squoo-bi-doop!

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:01.180
Yeah, that was a little off from where I had it, but...

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:03.120
HAAAAA-booski!

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:05.220
I've got it. I've got it.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.360
"Aerogel?" What the fuck is that?

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:08.700
*confused* What...?

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:12.200
Okay, anyway, we-we don't need to worry about that, because I need to grab one of those

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:13.940
titanium scrap pieces which should be...

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:17.280
...which WAS right in my lawn, but someone took it--there we go

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:19.740
that's what I needed right there--sandshark, get away!

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:21.040
I don't want you here!

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:23.520
But I got that. That's all I need for that.

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:26.380
Then I can put this in here--make it into titanium.

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:27.540
Four pieces of titanium!

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:28.040
*clap*

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:29.140
How hard was that?!

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.100
Why'd that have to be so hard?!

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.580
Okay, so we got that...

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:33.440
