00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:39.180
Oh no, wait, I wanted to put the duffel bag down, for some reason. (you picked it up)

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:40.640
No, no no no, no no no.

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:41.380
No no. (yes.)

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:45.760
I need food, but I need to put the duffel bag...into slot 1, and put it...

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:49.740
...Riii-ght-right-right-right-right-right...

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:51.440
Right there.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:52.620
