00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:56.100
That doesn't do anything. That's a decoration piece.

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.780
Ah. That's not actual storage.

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:00.020
Eeeeeyyy, it's fuckin' bullshet.

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:00.840
