00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.760
That's right, I need to put the naaaa-mes!

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:10.200
Yes! Okay, so I gonna' do that, I'm gonna...

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:12.260
I'm gonna' put up a bit higher than I had them before.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:13.960
