00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.840
Aaaaand habooski!

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:17.620
Okay. There we go.

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:18.680
*delighted shout*

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:20.380
The lockers are back! (hallelujah!)

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:22.680
*delighted cheering*

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:25.200
Okay, anyway, so I need to put this stuff away.

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:26.640
