00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:30.060
Put the copper away, put the lead away, salt, glass, "that"!

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:32.600
Uh, this. Uhm...where did I get so much glass?

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:33.640
Did I make all that glass? (pretty sure you did)

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:34.740
Did I need to make all that glass? (probably not)

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.620
Flare! We got the re-breather I'm gonna' keep on me.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.280
Rotten lantern fruit can go in there. (not the minerals)

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:42.660
Let's see if we can make a grow-bed...we don't have the titanium at the moment.

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:45.800
But that's because I put it away, maybe? Yes, I did.

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:48.680
Okay, so I'm gonna' try to make an interior grow-bed.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.520
Put it riiii-ght...

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:52.680
Shoo-bi-di-shoo-bi-di-shoo-bi-di-shoo-bi-di-shoo-bi-di.

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:57.340
And can I put--okay, can I put the rotten thing in there and will it grow?...

00:14:57.340 --> 00:14:58.400
...is the question.

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:00.240
Can I put the...rocket--

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:00.920
*plants fruit*

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:02.000
Yay?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.620
