00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:06.780
Aaaaaaaah yeah, there it is! Yes!

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:09.080
We got food growin'!

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:10.260
*morale forever lifted* Yay!

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:13.160
*clap* Ohhh, this is a wonderful day!

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:18.460
Ohh, it's a wonderful day, and when that grows, it's gonna' be SO NICE

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:21.460
