00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.880
It's gonna' grow so nice, and we gonna' be able to--

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:24.380
*lantern delicacies*

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:25.520
--eat our own food.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:31.340
But, right now, I actually don't have any food, and we're running... low on power 'cause it's currently night-time.

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:33.240
Oh man, that was a slog.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:34.740
That was an adventure.

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.660
That was a waste of time. (whut.)

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:41.180
But that's okay, because that's all part of the experience! (damn straight)

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:43.240
So, before I end this episode here,

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:46.420
I am going to...try to get a bead--ooh.

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:51.960
Try to get a lock on materials, supplies, everything I need, and also source some food.

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:54.280
So, if any of you slowpokes want to...

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:55.640
be eaten by me, yep.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:56.860
Apparently, they do.

00:15:56.960 --> 00:16:00.900
So, I got some slowpokes here; hoverfish, peeper, and all that jazz.

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:03.620
That's good, because we can just eat those up.

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:04.560
Nyum-yum-yum!

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:08.100
And then I'm pretty close to the Aurora; I'm pretty close to where I need to go.

