Wha-what I need for the Aurora, what I have been told

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:13.780
is the Repulsion Cannon and the Propulsion Cannon,

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:17.580
but the interesting thing is the schematics for those

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:21.000
are actually near the outside entrance of the Aurora.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:23.780
So, I need that to be able to get into the Aurora

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:27.480
