00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:31.700
And I'm willing to bet that the Exo-suit is in there, somewhere.

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:34.560
I don't know for certain, but I'm guessing.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:36.860
So, with all that said and done,

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:39.580
I just need a little more materials, and then...

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:42.220
we'll be able to moooo-ve on.

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:44.320
Mmkay...

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:49.680
We've got materials; I'mma' make one more of these bad boys.

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:53.000
Uhh...stack 'em real nice and tight like that.

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.640
Ahh-boink.

