I'm gonna' make a spot-light just so that I...

00:16:57.900 --> 00:17:01.240
...can know where the frick my door is.

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:04.880
I'm gonna' put this heeeeeeere--there.

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:07.300
Okay, haaa-booski.

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:09.620
Okay, I know that's gonna' consume power,

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:13.660
but it's going to be useful for me finding this place in the darkness.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:16.660
And, I've got two solar panels anyway, so it should be okay.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.760
Ehh, consumes a lot of power, though. (yeah...)

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:20.180
*important choices being made*

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:22.260
Ehh, I'll deconstruct it if it's necessary.

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:24.600
So, I've got a grow-bed, a base.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.460
I've got a fabricator. I've got a locker!

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:28.780
I've got a duffel bag.

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:30.360
I'm doing pretty good for myself!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:33.640
And next up on the list is the Aurora itself,

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:36.980
which I'm going to tackle..very soon,

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:44.800
but now, officially, I have the lockers back, which means that I will be able put you guys' names on there. (sweet)

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:49.040
So, if you got any tips and tricks that you want me to do in the next episode

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:52.320
